## 🧹 Data Cleaning Process

### Issues Identified & Solutions
| Issue | Count | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Leading/trailing spaces | 1,247 rows | `TRIM()` function |
| Incorrect date formats | 89 rows | `PARSE_DATE()` |
| Duplicate Order IDs | 15 rows | `ROW_NUMBER()` |
| NULL revenue values | 23 rows | `COALESCE()` or removed |
| Special characters | 32 rows | `REGEXP_REPLACE()` |

### Sample SQL Queries
```sql
-- Remove leading/trailing spaces
UPDATE northstar_sales
SET product = TRIM(product),
    city = TRIM(city);

-- Remove duplicate orders
WITH deduped AS (
    SELECT *,
           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY order_id ORDER BY order_date) as rn
    FROM northstar_sales
)
SELECT * EXCEPT(rn)
FROM deduped
WHERE rn = 1;

-- Calculate Total Revenue by Product
SELECT 
    product,
    SUM(revenue) as total_revenue
FROM northstar_sales_deduped
GROUP BY product
ORDER BY total_revenue DESC;
